OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy, with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof light rain and drizzle possible in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. A southeasterly wind
OL,8,Fstrengthens throughout the day,
OL,9,Fbecoming strong along coasts and
OL,10,Fexposed areas. Sea fog may affect
OL,11,Fcoastal areas for a time.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy. Overnight,
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavy and
OL,15,Fblustery for some, moving in from the
OL,16,Fwest by Wednesday morning. Staying
OL,17,Fwindy, especially along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
