OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA wet start, with some
OL,6,Fpotentially heavy and blustery
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain. Brighter, with the
OL,8,Fwind easing once rain clears, but
OL,9,Fshowers developing later inland.
OL,10,FStaying clearer along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FLargely dry and sunny on Thursday,
OL,14,Fclouding over later. Breezy with
OL,15,Fshowers, heavy at times, on Friday.
OL,16,FMostly dry but cloudy with the wind
OL,17,Feasing on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
